{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"agent_message","text":"The random title draw picked **Pitfallin’**. The expedition will span six jungle regions, with vine swings, timed crocodile crossings, rolling logs, snakes, and two underground passages. Multiplayer will be a ghost race: players can see each other while keeping their own hazards and treasure.\n"}}
