{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'computeColliderMovement|computedGrounded|castRay\\\\(' node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts && cat node_modules/three/package.json | head -30\"","aggregated_output":"node_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/pipeline/world.d.ts:330:    castRay(ray: Ray, maxToi: number, solid: boolean, filterFlags?: QueryFilterFlags, filterGroups?: InteractionGroups, filterExcludeCollider?: Collider, filterExcludeRigidBody?: RigidBody, filterPred [... omitted end of long line]\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:169:    computeColliderMovement(collider: Collider, desiredTranslationDelta: Vector, filterFlags?: QueryFilterFlags, filterGroups?: InteractionGroups, filterPredicate?: (collider: Collider) => boolean): v [... omitted end of long line]\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:171:     * The movement computed by the last call to `this.computeColliderMovement`.\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:175:     * The result of ground detection computed by the last call to `this.computeColliderMovement`.\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:177:    computedGrounded(): boolean;\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:180:     * to `this.computeColliderMovement`.\nnode_modules/@dimforge/rapier3d-compat/control/character_controller.d.ts:185:     * call to `this.computeColliderMovement`.\n{\n  \"name\": \"three\",\n  \"version\": \"0.180.0\",\n  \"description\": \"JavaScript 3D library\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"./build/three.cjs\",\n  \"module\": \"./build/three.module.js\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": {\n      \"import\": \"./build/three.module.js\",\n      \"require\": \"./build/three.cjs\"\n  