{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The full expedition now passes an input-only playthrough with default settings and no teleports or cheats. The test collected all six relics, used every vine and both caves, and reached the exit. We also traced the WebGPU problem to the software-driver launch flags; I’m checking the corrected configuration and adding recovery if a graphics device is lost.\n"}}
