dge the art; native WebGPU under virtual X and compatibility captures supplied useful visual evidence.\"\n\t],\n\t\"engineFeedback\": [\n\t\t\"Three.js makes procedural scenes and native clip animation straightforward; Rapier provides reliable character collisions.\",\n\t\t\"The supplied software WebGPU adapter flag lost or stalled devices, even with two boxes. A Vulkan SwiftShader configuration rendered correctly; automatic WebGL2 recovery covers device loss and stalls.\",\n\t\t\"The platforming state machine, vine attachment, level data, controller menus and multiplayer lifecycle.\",\n\t\t\"Coordinating kinematic physics, vine motion and layered side-on composition.\",\n\t\t\"none\",\n\t\t\"A compact, first-party character-controller and gamepad-menu starter would reduce setup.\"\n\t],\n\t\"promptFeedback\": [\n\t\t\"The source, visual style, controller-first UX and explicit finished-demo requirements give a clear creative target.\",\n\t\t\"No major ambiguity; standalone multiplayer needed a practical pairing design without a supplied signaling service.\",\n\t\t\"Delivering traversal, rich procedural art, accessible input and two multiplayer transports in one offline HTML.\",\n\t\t\"Specify whether standalone internet play should include hosted signaling or manual peer pairing.\"\n\t],\n\t\"aiHub\": {\n\t\t\"name\": \"Pitfallin’\",\n\t\t\"tagline\": \"A little danger. A lot of jungle.\",\n\t\t\"description\": \"Swing through an ink-drawn jungle, hop crocodile jaws and explore beneath the roots. Find six lost sun relics before sunset, solo or alongside your friends’ racing ghosts.\",\n\t\t\"type\": \"Game\",\n\t\t\"genre\": \"Platformer\",\n\t\t\"source\": \"Pitfall! (1982)\",\n\t\t\"series\": \"\",\n\t\t\"players\": \"1–4\",\n\t\t\"controls\": \"A/D or left stick move; Space/Cross jump or release; E/Square catch vine; W/S or stick up/down climb; M/Triangle map; Esc/Options pause. Touch: left drag moves, right tap jumps, contextual action assists.\",\n\t\t\"tags\": [\n\t\t\t\"side-scrolling\",\n\t\t\t\"3d\",\n\t\t\t\"adventure\",\n\t\t\t\"retro\",\n\t\t\t\"ghost-race\",\n\t\t\t\"jungle\"\n\t\t]\n\t}\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
